it (\"1,057 ₪\"). I glanced at the orange and yellow bars without knowing what each colour meant. I read the grey \"לא בחישוב\" notes.\n- **Sensitivity table:** I read the \"המספר\" and \"ההפרש\" columns. I ignored the line chart above it.\n- **Hedging table:** I only read the \"המדד בדולרים\" column, to see how the S&P did each year. I ignored the columns with \"עד\" ranges.\n- **\"עכשיו\" lists:** I read \"עוד\" / \"פחות\" and the green and red bars. It was easy to see who's bad.\n- **Waterfall:** I only read the two numbers \"79,176 ₪\" and \"86,492 ₪\".\n\n## 5. What I didn't understand\n\n- **\"(4D)\" vs \"(4A)\":** what the letters mean.\n- **\"קרן מחקה\" vs \"קרן סל\":** whether there's a difference I should care about.\n- **\"נאמן\"** (0.02%) and **\"קבועים / משתנים\"**.\n- **\"נטרול מט\"ח\" / \"מנוטרלת מט\"ח\"** and **\"חשיפה לדולר\"**.\n- **\"עסקת החלף\"**, **\"צוברת\"**, **\"W-8BEN\"**, **\"מס עיזבון אמריקאי\"**.\n- **The popup \"מס רק במכירה\":** it says \"לא נמצא כלל שממסה יחיד על רווחים שקרן זרה צוברת…\". I didn't understand it, and it stayed on screen the whole time, covering the left side of every part of the page.\n- **\"הדרך מוצגת בלי דירוג\"**: which \"path\" it means.\n- **The waterfall's starting point**, MTF + Jerusalem.\n\n## 6. What I wanted and couldn't find\n\n- **Youth prices:** what the youth price actually is at Leumi or Hapoalim, and whether it beats Psagot for me.\n- **Next steps:** how to open the account and buy the fund. What do I click, is there a minimum, and can I set up 500 ₪ a month automatically?\n- **Psagot's 1,057 ₪:** what it's made of. Is it a monthly fee, or a fee each time I buy?\n- **Exactly what I'll pay:** tax when I sell, as a simple number or percent.\n- **Risk:** what happens if the market drops, and whether my money is safe if Ilin or Psagot has problems.\n\n## 7. If half the page had to go\n\nI'd cut these first:\n1. The \"נטרול מט\"ח\" section with its two bar charts and yearly table.\n2. \"מה כתוב בפרסום, מול התעריפון\".\n3. The waterfall chart.\n4. The foreign funds (iShares, Vanguard, \"אין מחיר כאן\").\n5. The line chart in the sensitivity part, keeping the table.\n6. The coloured tags on every fund.\n\nI'd keep the calculator, the result card, the account list, and the green/red \"עכשיו\" lists.","ttft_ms":5745,"type":"result","duration_ms":52129,"uuid":"955a9b43-9285-495e-883a-7a1bcd39eb0b","ttft_stream_ms":5050,"time_to_request_ms":226,"first_content_frame_ms":5051,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":8,"outputTokens":4686,"cacheReadInputTokens":35574,"cacheCreationInputTokens":21148,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.2700508,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":990,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":21148,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-04T19:30:42.667Z"}
